=== TEST OPERATOR PRECEDENCE ===
=== ARITMATIKA ===
2 + 3 * 4 = 14 (seharusnya 14)
(2 + 3) * 4 = 20 (seharusnya 20)
10 + 20 / 5 = 14 (seharusnya 14)
10 + 20 % 7 = 16 (seharusnya 16)
2 + 3 ** 2 = 11 (seharusnya 11)
2 ** 3 ** 2 = 512 (seharusnya 512)
(2 ** 3) ** 2 = 64 (seharusnya 64)
=== LOGIKA DAN PERBANDINGAN ===
x < y dan y < z = benar
x + y > z atau x > y = salah
bukan x > y = benar
=== CAMPURAN ===
10 + 5 * 2 - 8 / 4 + 3 ** 2 = 27
(5 + 3) * 2 == 16 dan bukan (4 < 2) = benar
=== BITWISE ===
1 + 2 << 2 = 12 (seharusnya 3 << 2 = 12)
(1 + 2) << 2 = 12
5 & 3 == 1 = 0
=== ASSIGNMENT ===
n += 5 * 2 -> n = 20 (seharusnya 20)
n *= 2 + 3 -> n = 100 (seharusnya 20 * 5 = 100)
